    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414300/extras/42dd49136cf294d6f19e6987f9d80632.avif?t=1695805272\" /></div><br><br>BeetleQuest is an adventure game inspired by games like King\u2019s Quest and Legends of Kyrandia. It is based on children\u2019s books and fairytales, and is suitable for all ages!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2>In BeetleQuest, three beetle friends, Magnus, Boris and Dagmar are playing with their most cherished marble, when Boris accidentally shoots it down into a molehill.<br><br>The mole inside becomes very angry for he has suffered a huge bump on his head. He refuses to return the marble. He says he will only give the marble back if the beetlefriends give him a nice gift in return.<br><br>And so, their quest begins!  Off they go to search for a nice gift for the mole so they can get their precious marble back.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2>* A charming story with lots of point &amp; click goodness.<br><br>* Fully hand-drawn backgrounds, characters and animations.<br>* Three beetles to choose from. Play as Magnus, Dagmar, or Boris.<br>* Visit exciting places, like a mysterious swamp, a dark cave, and even a land underwater!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Extra's</h2>* The game is also fully in Dutch. <br><br>* The old, pre-remake version of the game is available via the Beta branch.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414300/extras/5f1b8da3a5f9d82f7f68d41f98225ba8.avif?t=1695805272\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414300/extras/42dd49136cf294d6f19e6987f9d80632.avif?t=1695805272\" /></div><br><br>BeetleQuest is an adventure game inspired by games like King\u2019s Quest and Legends of Kyrandia. It is based on children\u2019s books and fairytales, and is suitable for all ages!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2>In BeetleQuest, three beetle friends, Magnus, Boris and Dagmar are playing with their most cherished marble, when Boris accidentally shoots it down into a molehill.<br><br>The mole inside becomes very angry for he has suffered a huge bump on his head. He refuses to return the marble. He says he will only give the marble back if the beetlefriends give him a nice gift in return.<br><br>And so, their quest begins!  Off they go to search for a nice gift for the mole so they can get their precious marble back.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2>* A charming story with lots of point &amp; click goodness.<br><br>* Fully hand-drawn backgrounds, characters and animations.<br>* Three beetles to choose from. Play as Magnus, Dagmar, or Boris.<br>* Visit exciting places, like a mysterious swamp, a dark cave, and even a land underwater!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Extra's</h2>* The game is also fully in Dutch. <br><br>* The old, pre-remake version of the game is available via the Beta branch.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414300/extras/5f1b8da3a5f9d82f7f68d41f98225ba8.avif?t=1695805272\" /></div>",
